# Paths up to DOS's 64 characters, and no further (rxlib.DEEP_PATH): the
# directory whose path is 64 characters long is reached, one of 66 is not.
program: shell
media: B deep
keys: b:\ncd \\aaaaaaaa\\bbbbbbbb\\cccccccc\\dddddddd\\eeeeeeee\\ffffffff\ncd abcdefg.x\ncd ..\ncd abcdefgh.xy\ndir abcdefgh.xy\n
timeout: 60
emulators: bochs mame
---
rx286, test build
rx286 shell: type help for the commands
A:\>b:
B:\>cd \aaaaaaaa\bbbbbbbb\cccccccc\dddddddd\eeeeeeee\ffffffff
B:\AAAAAAAA\BBBBBBBB\CCCCCCCC\DDDDDDDD\EEEEEEEE\FFFFFFFF>cd abcdefg.x
B:\AAAAAAAA\BBBBBBBB\CCCCCCCC\DDDDDDDD\EEEEEEEE\FFFFFFFF\ABCDEFG.X>cd ..
B:\AAAAAAAA\BBBBBBBB\CCCCCCCC\DDDDDDDD\EEEEEEEE\FFFFFFFF>cd abcdefgh.xy
Invalid directory
B:\AAAAAAAA\BBBBBBBB\CCCCCCCC\DDDDDDDD\EEEEEEEE\FFFFFFFF>dir abcdefgh.xy
Invalid path
B:\AAAAAAAA\BBBBBBBB\CCCCCCCC\DDDDDDDD\EEEEEEEE\FFFFFFFF>
